From 0f39a0fdbb287826ff1b16cf6060068ade11e563 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:56:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Keep a queued download's file count and size, so a removed
 release still shows them

The queue row read both from the release's files, which go with the release. The queue rows now store both when the entry is queued, and the Pinning screen shows them for a release no longer in the library, as its board draws.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019wwAR8vet2nCM1HhYR5VRz
